{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1124648699"}, "name":{"label":"Lack common sense"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-08T11:58:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.21.0"}, "id":{"label":"12992201050"}, "title":{"label":"Too much money in your wallet? Buy this app!"}, "content":{"label":"$6.99 a month?? That’s per person that means $14 if you’re in a real relationship that you gotta pay for! Congratulations! You’ve lost $168 this year! For an app! Best of all!  They don’t say this untill you give them all your information first! Don’t get me wrong yeah it’s a cool app and work went into it! But a $168 a from every couple? Every year? Add that to your monthly subscription lists and stay broke! Just my opinion you should say what it costs before you waste your time downloading and making an account! That way the people that actually are willing to pay are the only ones downloading it!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
