{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id917890772"}, "name":{"label":"SophieS_13_"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-02T21:03:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.21.0"}, "id":{"label":"12969494011"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing"}, "content":{"label":"I actually never leave reviews but as my boyfriend and I get ready to be long distance for the first time, we decided to get this app and pay the 30$ to have unlimited quiz options and widgets. I love the ability to have a widget that says how far apart we are. We also have one that shows how many days we’ve been together. I also love that they have 100+ quizzes at LEAST to sit and answer with each other. It makes being farther apart not seem so far apart. There’s so many great parts of this app but it would take too long to go over all of them. Top features; the quizzes, ability to put memories in the app (thru writing them and posting pictures to a specific section) and all the options for widgets. I also suggest turning notifications ON. Reason being is that you get notifications every time your partner will complete something (like a quiz) so you can see results or complete your half. Couldn’t recommend this enough to couples long distance or just couples in general because of the fun questions and getting to know each other sections of the app. I love it, he loves it, and the only thing I’d love more is if they added more questions/quizzes. BTW- app is free to use but pay extra if you want to have unlimited amount of questions/quizzes available and widgets.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
